  "summary": "Malicious code in merchantweb-lang-cookie-reset (npm)",
  "details": "Merchantweb-lang-cookie-reset@0.0.6 is a stub package with no functional code (index.js exports only name and version). It declares a single dependency, packet-table-thread-stream, resolved from the non-standard host hxxps://artifacts[.]yosiroute[.]com/npm/packet-table-thread-stream. The shrinkwrap metadata shows that dependency has hasInstallScript: true, meaning it will execute install-time lifecycle hooks fetched from the attacker-controlled server. The package has no repository, no description beyond \"Generated package\", and exists solely to route npm install to an external registry where the attacker controls the payload.",
